<law>
	<structure>
		<unit label="title" identifier="59.1" level="1">Trade and Commerce</unit>
		<unit label="chapter" identifier="9" level="2">Secondhand Articles</unit>
		<unit label="article" identifier="1" level="3">Building Fixtures</unit>
	</structure>
	<section_number>59.1-124</section_number>
	<catch_line>Penalty for violation</catch_line>
	<text>
		Any person who violates this article shall be guilty of a Class 3 misdemeanor. A person convicted of a second or subsequent offense under this article is guilty of a Class 1 misdemeanor.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 59-152; 1968, c. 439; 1972, c. 598; 1988, c. 765; 2010, c. 805.</history>
</law>
